options placed before a sweep, and between a sweep and its analysis
ground 0
load "resistor.osdi"
model resistor resistor
model vsource vsource
v1 (a 0) vsource dc=1
r1 (a b) resistor r=1k
r2 (b 0) resistor r=1k
control
  options rawfile="ascii"
  options reltol=1e-4
  sweep s1 instance="r1" parameter="r" values=[1k, 3k]
    analysis good op
  options reltol=1e-3
  analysis after op
endc
